        <description>An armor made from metal and bones that is typically worn by veteran and even elite members of the Blood Rain. The armor features skulls as shoulder pads and is carved with basic runes that enhance the physical prowess of the wearer. The human skulls generally come from unfortunate victims who met their demise in a Blood Rain raid, or from deceased relatives of Blood Rain members.</description>
